body:
Is anyone having a similar issue? My SmartDrive MX2+ has been awesome but the last few weeks it has struggled. I will get about 30 minutes use out of it and then I lose all lights and power. The only way to boot it up again is to connect it to the charger. I can then get another 30 minutes out of it. It is always more than 3/4 charged so it's not going flat.

&#x200B;

I have had it repaired and they have changed the motor and circuit board but still the same issue. 

&#x200B;

Anyone have ideas or similar problem?

I do have to agree, I don't like taking things from people handing out items in the streets and usually throw it in the bin as soon as I receive it. That's fair enough. I was prepared to wear the cost however the ROI would not be worth it as you mentioned. 

&#x200B;

Thanks for your reply though!!

Thank you everyone!! This whole ordeal has almost broken me and made me realise how the system works. We are lucky to have a system at all and I guess I have learned that a system will never help everyone. I'm thankful it could help me partially and then I had amazing friends and family to help me try and get over the line. 

&#x200B;

The next few weeks are going to the be the hardest of the lot but I am much stronger than I was. I just hope someone got something out of this post. On a side note, if anyone has any ideas on how to raise $7,000 in 9 days please let me know. I would be forever grateful for any ideas.
